{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》 踏入結局周，「瘋批奶奶」江美儀掌摑兼連環捶打張曦雯，爆極致婆媳大戰！</p><p>昨晚江美儀與張曦雯（Kelly）先後因陳煒兒子行蹤外洩，以及周志康生死安危問題再度爆發激烈衝突。</p><p>爭住要做好人的吳卓羲背後女人的二人，句句有骨互懟原本</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:22:13.073352+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:14:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T14:18:23.213963+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T14:18:23.213963+00:00","content_hash":"d40ee84365d1b8936104c10883074acfff583957ce925c3d871df66d424d370f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}